#3806
Slaive's Forgotten Refuge~
The cramped burrow opens into a surprisingly deliberate refuge. A narrow
bed alcove, stone worktable, shelves cut into the wall, and a concealed
iron safe show that someone lived here for years. Old maps of Midgaard
curl beside coded tallies and faded theft schedules. One shelving recess
is suspiciously deep, its back formed from a single fitted slab. At the
center of the chamber lies Slaive, the knifemaster who vanished beneath
the city and never returned to the streets above.
~
